    {
      "subId": "7217204",
      "subQuestName": "Destroy the Perches",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721720401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721720401": {
            "id": "721720401",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Ah, it's you two...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720402"
            ]
          },
          "721720402": {
            "id": "721720402",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Have there been any new developments?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720403"
            ]
          },
          "721720403": {
            "id": "721720403",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720404"
            ]
          },
          "721720404": {
            "id": "721720404",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Mm, I've got it. Now, let's break this down simply...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720405"
            ]
          },
          "721720405": {
            "id": "721720405",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "According to your plot, the flow of time in Tsurumi Island does not match that of the outside world. If it were me, I certainly would — as you have — ascribed this to a special ley line disorder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720406"
            ]
          },
          "721720406": {
            "id": "721720406",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "I doubt that such a ley line disorder could occur naturally, so... Let's just say it fell from the skies? Maybe it was a fragment of Celestia, or something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720490"
            ]
          },
          "721720490": {
            "id": "721720490",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Which then mixed together with the lightning storms created by the Thunderbird to create these phenomena—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720407"
            ]
          },
          "721720407": {
            "id": "721720407",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "—And I'd give this plot a 4 out of 10, maybe. It's usable, but it's hard to execute. There should be a more elegant way of writing this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720408"
            ]
          },
          "721720408": {
            "id": "721720408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What do you mean when you say \"plot,\" anyway...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720409"
            ]
          },
          "721720409": {
            "id": "721720409",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Oh, don't worry about it. It's nothing of particular note...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720410"
            ]
          },
          "721720410": {
            "id": "721720410",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "So if we want to push the story forward, we need a few more plot points in play — for example... \"The Tsurumi tragedy was born from a misunderstanding.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720411"
            ]
          },
          "721720411": {
            "id": "721720411",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "That's what I'd write, anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720412"
            ]
          },
          "721720412": {
            "id": "721720412",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "For example, the priests and Ruu might have taken the Thunderbird's favor upon Ruu as a sign that it wanted him as a sacrifice, but in truth, the Thunderbird might have just liked him in particular.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720413"
            ]
          },
          "721720413": {
            "id": "721720413",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "I suppose the resolution to such a plotline would simply be to find a way to convey Ruu's feelings to the Thunderbird.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720417"
            ]
          },
          "721720417": {
            "id": "721720417",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720418"
            ]
          },
          "721720418": {
            "id": "721720418",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Well, I can't say for sure, but I don't think there's any problem with this progression, per se. I remember a very popular series that ran for at least a few dozen volumes with this plot as the basis for its story!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720419"
            ]
          },
          "721720419": {
            "id": "721720419",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "You just need to find some ways to continuously insert various happenings that pose obstacles to the misunderstanding's resolution and allow it to fester! Why, that book...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720420"
            ]
          },
          "721720420": {
            "id": "721720420",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Could we get back on topic?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720421"
            ]
          },
          "721720421": {
            "id": "721720421",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Oh. Right. Sorry...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720422"
            ]
          },
          "721720422": {
            "id": "721720422",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "But according to the developments you've mentioned, since the Thunderbird was vanquished on Seirai Island, and Ruu himself is but a shade of the past, then you can only avert this catastrophe via some mystical means.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720423"
            ]
          },
          "721720423": {
            "id": "721720423",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Hmmm, this... This really is quite hard to write. There are so many things that would be hard to explain. Unacceptable. \"The Chronicles of the Sea of Fog (Working Title)\" can't be that sort of story...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720424"
            ]
          },
          "721720424": {
            "id": "721720424",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "#Do you have any other ideas, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720425"
            ]
          },
          "721720425": {
            "id": "721720425",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Mind if we say something about Kama for a moment?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720426"
            ]
          },
          "721720426": {
            "id": "721720426",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Oh, you've seen him around, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720427"
            ]
          },
          "721720427": {
            "id": "721720427",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "...Wait, what? Kama is a descendant of Tsurumi Island's natives?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720428"
            ]
          },
          "721720428": {
            "id": "721720428",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "L—Let's go look for him — right now!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217209",
      "subQuestName": "Search for the Perch's scattered power",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721720901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721720901": {
            "id": "721720901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That should be all of those perches.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720902"
            ]
          },
          "721720902": {
            "id": "721720902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's hope that's enough to stop the ceremony.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720906",
              "721720905"
            ]
          },
          "721720906": {
            "id": "721720906",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We've got no clue where Ruu is..."
          },
          "721720905": {
            "id": "721720905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon knows that! But..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217210",
      "subQuestName": "Destroy the Perches",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721721001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721721001": {
            "id": "721721001",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ruu! You're alright...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721002"
            ]
          },
          "721721002": {
            "id": "721721002",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, Paimon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721003"
            ]
          },
          "721721003": {
            "id": "721721003",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Why... Why did you do this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721004"
            ]
          },
          "721721004": {
            "id": "721721004",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721005"
            ]
          },
          "721721005": {
            "id": "721721005",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I thought that the two of you were good, strong people...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721006"
            ]
          },
          "721721006": {
            "id": "721721006",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "And that you'd be different from the others! You came back to look for me, listened to everything I said... I thought that the ceremony would go well this time... But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721007"
            ]
          },
          "721721007": {
            "id": "721721007",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We want to stop the ceremony! That way, you'll be safe!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721009"
            ]
          },
          "721721009": {
            "id": "721721009",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "But you're not helping!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721011"
            ]
          },
          "721721011": {
            "id": "721721011",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Back then... Something happened. Something went wrong. Things were going so well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721012"
            ]
          },
          "721721012": {
            "id": "721721012",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "But then I woke up. I found that the island had become like this. Everyone was weird. No one could see me. No one could hear me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721013"
            ]
          },
          "721721013": {
            "id": "721721013",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Then after a while, a storm would start, and it would be super scary. At these times, only Wakukau, Oina, and Autake wouldn't be struck by lightning. I'd hide there and wait for the storm to end.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721014"
            ]
          },
          "721721014": {
            "id": "721721014",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "But once the thunder stopped, everything would repeat all over again. I would wake up — and everyone would be doing the same things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721015"
            ]
          },
          "721721015": {
            "id": "721721015",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "Kapatcir's missing, too. I couldn't find her, not even on Mt. Kanna.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721016"
            ]
          },
          "721721016": {
            "id": "721721016",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "The ceremony must have gone wrong. We must've made her angry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721090"
            ]
          },
          "721721090": {
            "id": "721721090",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "That's why I prepared another ceremony, and another, and another. But it always ends the same. That's why I had the idea of bringing in people from the outside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721017"
            ]
          },
          "721721017": {
            "id": "721721017",
            "speakerId": 20320,
            "speakerName": "Ruu",
            "text": "I thought that... you were my friends, and that you'd help me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721018"
            ]
          },
          "721721018": {
            "id": "721721018",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Actually, hold on a moment. Who is Kapatcir, anyway?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217217",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721720301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721720301": {
            "id": "721720301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh! It works! It really works!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720302"
            ]
          },
          "721720302": {
            "id": "721720302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "C'mon, let's go get the rest!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720304",
              "721720307"
            ]
          },
          "721720304": {
            "id": "721720304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But we've met Ruu, haven't we? That isn't something that happened in the past.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720305"
            ]
          },
          "721720305": {
            "id": "721720305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's keep going!"
          },
          "721720307": {
            "id": "721720307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh-huh!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217205",
      "subQuestName": "Destroy the Perches",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721720501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721720501": {
            "id": "721720501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Th—That was close!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720502"
            ]
          },
          "721720502": {
            "id": "721720502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We barely managed to get out...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720503"
            ]
          },
          "721720503": {
            "id": "721720503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "S—So this is the storm that Kama talked about...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720504"
            ]
          },
          "721720504": {
            "id": "721720504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It could've been a result of us destroying the Perches.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720505"
            ]
          },
          "721720505": {
            "id": "721720505",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's true. They did have power in them after all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720506"
            ]
          },
          "721720506": {
            "id": "721720506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh-oh! If it's storming out there, Ruu might be in danger...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720508",
              "721720510"
            ]
          },
          "721720508": {
            "id": "721720508",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe, but... Paimon's still worried.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721720512"
            ]
          },
          "721720512": {
            "id": "721720512",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, let's double back and see if we can find him, then."
          },
          "721720510": {
            "id": "721720510",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It'll be hard, yeah, but we should go check on him anyway."
          }
        }
      }
    },
