    {
      "subId": "7217216",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sumida",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7217226",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sumida",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721721501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721721501": {
            "id": "721721501",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "#...It is as {NICKNAME} says. I am a descendant of the Tsurumi Island natives.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721502"
            ]
          },
          "721721502": {
            "id": "721721502",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Why didn't you tell me that earlier? All those times I got you to send those people there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721503"
            ]
          },
          "721721503": {
            "id": "721721503",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "You never asked, Lady Sumida.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721504"
            ]
          },
          "721721504": {
            "id": "721721504",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "*sigh* Well, that is just how you are, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721505"
            ]
          },
          "721721505": {
            "id": "721721505",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721506"
            ]
          },
          "721721506": {
            "id": "721721506",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "Nor will telling Tsurumi's story edify anyone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721507"
            ]
          },
          "721721507": {
            "id": "721721507",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "My father clung to that story till his dying day. From the time I was young, he would often take me there. It's a gloomy place, one filled with nothing but terrible memories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721508"
            ]
          },
          "721721508": {
            "id": "721721508",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "But had you asked me, Lady Sumida, I would have told you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721511"
            ]
          },
          "721721511": {
            "id": "721721511",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "...You're right. If I had been more willing to ask for his opinion and trusted him more, I wouldn't have had to do this in such a roundabout fashion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721512"
            ]
          },
          "721721512": {
            "id": "721721512",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "I'm sorry, Kama.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721513"
            ]
          },
          "721721513": {
            "id": "721721513",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "It's alright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721514"
            ]
          },
          "721721514": {
            "id": "721721514",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "W—Well then, as a remnant of Tsurumi Island, what do you think of this? \"The last scion of Tsurumi returns to his desolate homeland, only to be caught up in the twisted weft of time...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721515"
            ]
          },
          "721721515": {
            "id": "721721515",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Simply put, you hear the call of your ancestors and head into the mists of Tsurumi Island. Following the sound of the Maushiro, you traverse the fog, only to realize as you approach the site of that millennia-old ceremony...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721516"
            ]
          },
          "721721516": {
            "id": "721721516",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "...That you've become the same ancestor who bore your name all those years ago! There, you experience the island's final day — until violet lightning and roaring thunder rend the skies!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721590"
            ]
          },
          "721721590": {
            "id": "721721590",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Then you awake — only to have the same day begin again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721517"
            ]
          },
          "721721517": {
            "id": "721721517",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Well, what do you think? Is this plot \"This Novel Is Amazing!\" grand prize-worthy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721518"
            ]
          },
          "721721518": {
            "id": "721721518",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Will this really work...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721519"
            ]
          },
          "721721519": {
            "id": "721721519",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "It's not that impressive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721520"
            ]
          },
          "721721520": {
            "id": "721721520",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Hmm, I get it, I get it. You probably greatly value Tsurumi's history, so it's no surprise that you might be offended by my fictional appropriations. So, how about this, then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721521"
            ]
          },
          "721721521": {
            "id": "721721521",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "I'm not talking about that. Tsurumi's history doesn't matter that much to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721591"
            ]
          },
          "721721591": {
            "id": "721721591",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "I just feel that this plot doesn't grab me as much as the \"Toki Alley Tales\" or \"Kino's Travels\" that you read to me before. Nor does it quite flow as freely as \"The Three Young Nobles.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721522"
            ]
          },
          "721721522": {
            "id": "721721522",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Uh... Um, that was... blunt of you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721523"
            ]
          },
          "721721523": {
            "id": "721721523",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "Sorry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721524"
            ]
          },
          "721721524": {
            "id": "721721524",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "N—No, don't apologize at moments like this. That just feels even more hurtful to me as a writer...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721525"
            ]
          },
          "721721525": {
            "id": "721721525",
            "speakerId": 20322,
            "speakerName": "Kama",
            "text": "Sorry, I shouldn't have apologized.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721721526"
            ]
          },
          "721721526": {
            "id": "721721526",
            "speakerId": 20321,
            "speakerName": "Sumida",
            "text": "Aghhh! This is so annoying — but most annoying of all is the fact that I can't refute your critique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
